.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SH "Picomatch"
.PP

.PP

.PP
\fR \fP \fR \fP \fR \fP \fR \fP 

.PP

.br
 
.br

.PP

.PP
\fBBlazing fast and accurate glob matcher written in JavaScript\&.\fP \fINo dependencies and full support for standard and extended Bash glob features, including braces, extglobs, POSIX brackets, and regular expressions\&.\fP 

.PP

.br
 
.br
.SS "Why picomatch?"
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBLightweight\fP - No dependencies
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBMinimal\fP - Tiny API surface\&. Main export is a function that takes a glob pattern and returns a matcher function\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBFast\fP - Loads in about 2ms (that's several times faster than a \fRsingle frame of a HD movie\fP at 60fps)
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBPerformant\fP - Use the returned matcher function to speed up repeat matching (like when watching files)
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBAccurate matching\fP - Using wildcards (\fR*\fP and \fR?\fP), globstars (\fR**\fP) for nested directories, \fBadvanced globbing\fP with extglobs, braces, and POSIX brackets, and support for escaping special characters with \fR\\\fP or quotes\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBWell tested\fP - Thousands of unit tests
.PP

.PP
See the \fBlibrary comparison\fP to other libraries\&.

.PP

